fifo.u_sva.FullBackward_A    assert  proven        informal-kind
fifo.u_sva.EmptyExact_A      assert  proven        informal-kind
fifo.u_sva.PushFull_A        assert  proven        informal-kind
fifo.u_sva.PopEmpty_A        assert  proven        informal-kind
fifo.u_sva.Sync_A            assert  proven        informal-kind
fifo.u_sva.FullReached_C     cover   covered       informal-kind depth 17
fifo.u_sva.PushFull_C        cover   covered       informal-kind depth 18
fifo.u_sva.PopEmpty_C        cover   covered       informal-kind depth 2
fifo.u_sva.Drained_C         cover   covered       informal-kind depth 33
=== bounded model checking alone: a search for counterexamples
property                     type    status        engine     detail
EmptyPtrs_A                  assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
CountPtrs_A                  assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
=== k-induction, each property alone
property                     type    status        engine     detail
EmptyPtrs_A                  assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
CountPtrs_A                  assert  proven        informal-kind
=== k-induction, with the property it just proved assumed
property                     type    status        engine     detail
EmptyPtrs_A                  assert  proven        informal-kind
CountPtrs_A                  assert  disabled      informal-kind
CountPtrs_M                  assume  unprocessed
=== IC3, no helper
property                     type    status        engine     detail
EmptyPtrs_A                  assert  proven        informal-ic3
CountPtrs_A                  assert  disabled      informal-kind
verdict: true, and out of reach of induction until a helper invariant is assumed
